+```text
+GET  /shim/api/v1/agent/pi-chat/sessions                                      -> 200  []
+GET  /shim/api/v1/agent/pi-chat/draft-.../state                               -> 200
+POST /shim/api/v1/agent/pi-chat/draft-.../prompt                              -> 202
